{"ex-3B04-1":{"id":"ex-3B04-1","chapter":"3B04","number":1,"title":"描述波動","question":"<p>學生在原本靜止的水面上產生水波。水面經過 3 s 的干擾後，產生如圖所示的波形。求波的振幅 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span>、波長 λ、週期 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和頻率 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span>。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/a8457ca12bb5c277df5a7cd7.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:209.3px\"/></p>","answer":"<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>A</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = 0.05 m</p><p>λ = 2.4 × <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = 1.6 m</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>T</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = 2 s</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>f</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>T</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = 0.5 Hz</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>在 3 s 內產生 1.5 個完整周期。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3B04_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"719143bc1d93724a7ffd6a651bc27c06d5bdf7dfaf3d342d53b6078897c1cbb9","segments":[{"page":9,"kind":"question","box":[185.4491,53.499995117187495,562.4491,180.81610107421875],"text":"例 題 1 描述波動\r\n學生在原本靜止的水面上產生水波。水\r\n面經過 3 s 的干擾後，產生如圖所示的\r\n波形。求波的振幅 A、波長 λ、週期 T\r\n和頻率 f。\r\n"},{"page":9,"kind":"answer","box":[185.4491,180.81610107421875,562.4491,366.6259951171875],"text":"題解\r\nA = 0.1\r\n2\r\n = 0.05 m\r\nλ = 2.4 ×\r\n2\r\n3\r\n = 1.6 m\r\nT = 3\r\n1.5\r\n = 2 s\r\nf = 1\r\nT\r\n = 1\r\n2\r\n = 0.5 Hz\r\n干擾源頭\r\n0.1 m\r\n2.4 m\r\n"},{"page":9,"kind":"tips","box":[40,49.499995117187495,181.4491,366.6259951171875],"text":"提提你\r\n3 s 內產生了1.5個完整波。\r\n另解：\r\nf = 完整波的數量\r\n時間\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"sharedMathematicalAnswer":true,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-3B04-2":{"id":"ex-3B04-2","chapter":"3B04","number":2,"title":"草繪波形","question":"<p>慧思持續上下抖動一條繩子，產生頻率和振幅恆定的波，她在時間 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0 開始抖動繩子，<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0.4 s 時繩上出現一個完整波。草繪 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0.5 s 時的波形。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/6eb7e95ed60594deedaccfa2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:232.6px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0.4 s 至 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0.5 s 期間，波行進了 0.1 s。</p><p>由於 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0.4 s，</p><p>0.1 s = 0.25<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>∴ 波向右行進了 0.25λ。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/92d927070a3d373cf36a4ef6.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:189.9px\"/></p>","tips":"<p>技巧</p><p>解難</p><p>繪畫某段時間後的波形 ① 以周期 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>T</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> 表示時間間隔。② 求波在該時間間隔內傳播的距離（以波長 λ 表示）。③ 把原來的波形沿傳播方向平移 ② 所得的距離，然後畫出其餘波形。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3B04_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"719143bc1d93724a7ffd6a651bc27c06d5bdf7dfaf3d342d53b6078897c1cbb9","segments":[{"page":9,"kind":"question","box":[185.4491,389.57189511718747,562.4491,532.8883972167969],"text":"例 題 2 草繪波形\r\n慧思持續上下抖動一條繩子，產生頻\r\n率和振幅恆定的波，她在時間 t = 0\r\n開始抖動繩子，t = 0.4 s 時繩上出現\r\n一個完整波。草繪 t = 0.5 s 時的波\r\n形。\r\n"},{"page":9,"kind":"answer","box":[185.4491,532.8883972167969,562.4491,743.2848951171875],"text":"題 解\r\n在 t = 0.4 s 至 t = 0.5 s 期間，波行進了 0.1 s。\r\n由於 T = 0.4 s，\r\n0.1 s = 0.25T\r\n∴ 波向右行進了 0.25λ。\r\n0.25λ\r\nt = 0.5 s\r\nt = 0.4 s\r\n"},{"page":9,"kind":"tips","box":[40,385.57189511718747,181.4491,743.2848951171875],"text":"草繪一段時間後的\r\n波形\r\n① 以週期 T 表示時距。\r\n② 計算波在這時距內\r\n行進的距離（以波長\r\nλ 表示）。\r\n③ 沿波的行進方向把\r\n原來的波形移動 ②\r\n所 得 出 的 距 離，然\r\n後畫出餘下的波形。\r\n技巧分析\r\n解 難\r\n技巧分析\r\n\r\n= 0.5 Hz\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-3B04-3":{"id":"ex-3B04-3","chapter":"3B04","number":3,"title":"波速率","question":"<p>右圖顯示波在時間 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 4 s 時的波形。</p><p>(a) 求波速率。</p><p>(b) 求波長。</p><p>(c) 求波的頻率。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/1da8df9be38e1a0529ca59a3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:213.1px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>v</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>t</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>d</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>8</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = 0.2 m s<sup>–1</sup></p><p>(b) λ = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>8</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = 0.4 m</p><p>(c) By <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>v</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>f</mtext></mrow></mrow></math>λ,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>f</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>v</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>λ</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = 0.5 Hz</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3B04_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"719143bc1d93724a7ffd6a651bc27c06d5bdf7dfaf3d342d53b6078897c1cbb9","segments":[{"page":11,"kind":"question","box":[185.4491,53.49989511718752,562.4491,214.81610107421875],"text":"例 題 3 波速率\r\n右圖顯示波在時間 t = 0 和 t = 4 s 時的\r\n波形。\r\n(a) 求波速率。\r\n(b) 求波長。\r\n(c) 求波的頻率。\r\n"},{"page":11,"kind":"answer","box":[185.4491,214.81610107421875,562.4491,385.4998951171875],"text":"題解\r\n(a) v = d\r\nt\r\n = 0.8\r\n4\r\n = 0.2 m s–1\r\n(b) λ = 0.8\r\n2\r\n = 0.4 m\r\n(c) 根據 v = fλ，\r\nf = v\r\nλ\r\n = 0.2\r\n0.4\r\n = 0.5 Hz\r\n80 cm\r\nt = 0\r\nt = 4 s\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"sharedMathematicalAnswer":true,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-3B04-4":{"id":"ex-3B04-4","chapter":"3B04","number":4,"title":"沿兩條相連繩子傳播的波","question":"<p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span> 是兩條均勻的繩，長度相同，但 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span> 比 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> 重，它們連接在一起成為一條長繩。長繩其中一端以木杆固定。學生如圖所示，以恆定的頻率抖動長繩的另一端來產生波。</p><p>當波從 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> 行進至 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span>，波的速率、頻率和波長會怎樣改變？試簡單解釋。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/be8f57874949711ed13369bd.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:506.6px\"/></p>","answer":"<p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span> 連接在一起，因此張力相同。<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span> 每單位長度的質量比 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> 大，所以當波從 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> 行進至 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span>，波速率 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span> 會減少。</p><p>波的頻率 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span> 與學生抖動長繩的頻率相同，所以不會改變。</p><p>根據 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span>λ，由於 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span> 減少而 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span> 保持恆定，所以 λ 會減少。</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3B04_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"719143bc1d93724a7ffd6a651bc27c06d5bdf7dfaf3d342d53b6078897c1cbb9","segments":[{"page":13,"kind":"question","box":[185.4491,53.49989511718752,562.4491,300.7734680175781],"text":"例 題 4 沿兩條相連繩子傳播的波\r\nA 和 B 是兩條均勻的繩，長度相同，但 B 比 A 重，它們連接在一起\r\n成為一條長繩。長繩其中一端以木杆固定。學生如圖所示，以恆定的\r\n頻率抖動長繩的另一端來產生波。\r\nA B\r\n木杆\r\n當波從 A 行進至 B，波的速率、頻率和波長會怎樣改變？試簡單\r\n解釋。\r\n"},{"page":13,"kind":"answer","box":[185.4491,300.7734680175781,562.4491,421.3098951171875],"text":"題解\r\nA 和 B 連接在一起，因此張力相同。B 每單位長度的質量比 A 大，所\r\n以當波從 A 行進至 B，波速率 v 會減少。\r\n波的頻率 f 與學生抖動長繩的頻率相同，所以不會改變。\r\n根據 v = fλ，由於 v 減少而 f 保持恆定，所以 λ 會減少。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-3B04-5":{"id":"ex-3B04-5","chapter":"3B04","number":5,"title":"波上粒子的運動","question":"<p>橫波沿繩子向左傳播。<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span>、<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span>、<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span>、<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span> 是繩子上的五個粒子。</p><p>(a) 描述粒子 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span>、<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span>、<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span>、<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span> 在所示一刻的運動。</p><p>(b) 寫出兩個同相的粒子。</p><p>(c) 寫出兩個反相的粒子。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/f8403bc756c3422964bf11f5.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:313.1px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span> 是瞬時靜止的。</p><p>考慮一段短時間後的波形。</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span> 都正向下移動。<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span> 都正向上移動。</p><p>(b) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>(c) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span> ( 或 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span>)</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/eac1abc9e2a590c710f766b7.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:385.9px\"/></p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>B 和 E 並不同相。雖然它們在這一刻都向上移動，但到達波峰的時刻不同。</p><p>提示</p><p>A 和 E 相距 1.5λ。D 和 E 相距 0.5λ。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3B04_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"719143bc1d93724a7ffd6a651bc27c06d5bdf7dfaf3d342d53b6078897c1cbb9","segments":[{"page":19,"kind":"question","box":[185.4491,53.49989511718741,562.4491,246.81610107421875],"text":"例 題 5 波上粒子的運動\r\n橫波沿繩子向左傳播。A、\r\nB、C、D 和 E 是繩子上的五\r\n個粒子。\r\n(a) 描述粒子 A、B、C、D\r\n和 E 在所示一刻的運動。\r\n(b) 寫出兩個同相的粒子。\r\n(c) 寫出兩個反相的粒子。\r\n"},{"page":19,"kind":"answer","box":[185.4491,246.81610107421875,562.4491,488.7438951171875],"text":"題解\r\n(a) C 是瞬時靜止的。\r\n考慮一段短時間後的波形。\r\nA D\r\nC\r\nB\r\nE\r\n傳播方向 一段短時間後\r\n在圖所示一刻\r\nA 和 D 都正向下移動。B 和 E 都正向上移動。\r\n(b) A 和 D\r\n(c) A 和 E ( 或 D 和 E)\r\nA D\r\nC\r\nB\r\nE\r\n傳播方向\r\n"},{"page":19,"kind":"tips","box":[40,49.49989511718741,181.4491,488.7438951171875],"text":"注意\r\n考慮一段短時間後的波\r\n形，就可以測定各粒子的\r\n運動，位於波峯或波谷的\r\n粒子除外。\r\n提提你\r\nB 和 E 並 不 是 同 相。雖 然\r\n它們在這一刻都正向上移\r\n動，但會在不同時刻到達波\r\n峯。\r\n提提你\r\nA 和 E 相距1.5λ。\r\nD和E相距05λ。"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-3B04-6":{"id":"ex-3B04-6","chapter":"3B04","number":6,"title":"不同時刻的位移—距離關係線圖","question":"<p>右圖顯示波的某部分在時間 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0 的波形。<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span>、<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span>、<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z</annotation></semantics></math></span> 是波上的粒子，波的週期是 4 s。</p><p>(a) 草繪波在以下時刻由 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span> 至 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的位移 — 距離關係線圖。</p><p>(i) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0</p><p>(ii) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 1 s</p><p>(b) 求波速率。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/d184c9b2ca32470fe2c500b5.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:222.8px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(ii)</p><p>(b) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>v</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>λ</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>T</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>8</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = 0.02 m s<sup>–1</sup></p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/fd10c5f18590d995a17111ec.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:316.5px\"/></p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/a4fd74a55a38b76486bfc631.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:265.9px\"/></p>","tips":"<p>技巧</p><p>繪圖</p><p>繪畫 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>s</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>–</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>d</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> 圖：先找出以下各項：</p><p>1 振幅</p><p>2 波長</p><p>3 平衡位置、波峰和波谷的位置（以確定曲線的方向）</p><p>提示</p><p>以最左方的粒子 W 作為參考點，因此 s–d 圖與波形的形狀相同。</p><p>A = 2 cm</p><p>λ = 4 × 2 = 8 cm</p><p>提示</p><p>T = 4 s ⇒ 1 s = 0.25T</p><p>波向右傳播了 0.25λ。</p><p>∴ Y（d = 4 cm）位於波峰。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3B04_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"719143bc1d93724a7ffd6a651bc27c06d5bdf7dfaf3d342d53b6078897c1cbb9","segments":[{"page":22,"kind":"question","box":[180.6491,196.73489511718753,557.6491,403.0509948730469],"text":"例 題 6 不同時刻的位移—距離關係線圖\r\n右圖顯示波的某部分在時間 t = 0 的波\r\n形。W、X、Y 和 Z 是波上的粒子，波\r\n的週期是 4 s。\r\n(a) 草繪波在以下時刻由 W 至 Z 的位\r\n移—距離關係線圖。\r\n (i) t = 0\r\n (ii) t = 1 s\r\n(b) 求波速率。\r\n"},{"page":22,"kind":"answer","box":[180.6491,403.0509948730469,557.6491,744.5878951171875],"text":"題解\r\n(a) (i) \r\n \r\n–2\r\n0\r\n2\r\n2 4 6\r\nd / cm \r\ns / cm\r\n (ii) \r\n \r\n–2\r\n0\r\n2\r\n2 4 6\r\nd / cm \r\ns / cm\r\n(b) v = λ\r\nT = 0.08\r\n4\r\n = 0.02 m s–1\r\n1 cm\r\n1 cm\r\nX\r\nZ\r\nY W\r\n"},{"page":22,"kind":"tips","box":[40,192.73489511718753,176.6491,744.5878951171875],"text":"提提你\r\n因為以最左面的粒子 W 為\r\n參考點，所以位移—距離\r\n關係線圖的形狀與波形相\r\n同。\r\nA = 2 cm\r\nλ = 4 × 2 = 8 cm\r\n提提你\r\nT = 4 s ⇒ 1 s = 0.25T\r\n波向右行進了0.25 λ\r\n∴ Y (d = 4 cm) 位於波峯。\r\n繪畫位移—距離關\r\n係線圖\r\n找出以下資料：\r\n1 振幅\r\n2 波長\r\n3 平衡位置、波峯和波\r\n谷（以判斷曲線的方\r\n向）\r\n繪畫線圖\r\n技巧分析 技巧分析\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"sharedMathematicalAnswer":true,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-3B04-7":{"id":"ex-3B04-7","chapter":"3B04","number":7,"title":"閱讀位移—時間關係線圖","question":"<p>右圖顯示波上某粒子的位移 — 時間關係線圖（取向上為正）。</p><p>(a) 波的振幅是多少？</p><p>(b) 在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0.2 s，粒子向哪個方向移動？</p><p>(c) 如果波長為 50 cm，波速率 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span> 是多少？</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/0138678a4a058eda3ffdb278.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:224.4px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 10 cm</p><p>(b) 正方向（向上）</p><p>(c) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>λ</mi><mi>T</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{λ}{T}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>0.5</mn><mn>0.4</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{0.5}{0.4}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 1.25 m s<sup>–1</sup></p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>在 t = 0.2 s 時，s 正在增加。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3B04_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"719143bc1d93724a7ffd6a651bc27c06d5bdf7dfaf3d342d53b6078897c1cbb9","segments":[{"page":24,"kind":"question","box":[180.6491,447.2848951171875,557.6491,624.6009979248047],"text":"例 題 7 閱讀位移—時間關係線圖\r\n右圖顯示波上某粒子的位移—時間關\r\n係線圖（取向上為正）。\r\n(a) 波的振幅是多少？\r\n(b) 在 t = 0.2 s，粒子向哪個方向\r\n移動？\r\n(c) 如果波長為 50 cm，波速率 v 是多少？\r\n"},{"page":24,"kind":"answer","box":[180.6491,624.6009979248047,557.6491,743.2848951171875],"text":"題解\r\n(a) 10 cm\r\n(b) 正方向（向上）\r\n(c) v = λ\r\nT\r\n = 0.5\r\n0.4\r\n = 1.25 m s–1\r\n–10\r\n0\r\n10\r\n0.2 0.4\r\nt / s\r\ns / cm\r\n"},{"page":24,"kind":"tips","box":[40,443.2848951171875,176.6491,743.2848951171875],"text":"提提你\r\n在 t = 0.2 s，s 正在增加。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-3B04-8":{"id":"ex-3B04-8","chapter":"3B04","number":8,"title":"繪畫不同粒子的位移—時間關係線圖","question":"<p>橫波向左傳播，速率為 0.5 m s<sup>–1</sup>，週期為 0.2 s。下圖顯示波在時間<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0 的波形。<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span>、<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span>、<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> 是波上的粒子。</p><p>取向上為正。</p><p>(a) 草繪粒子 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span> 從 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0 至 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0.4 s 的位移 — 時間關係線圖。</p><p>(b) 在 (a) 的線圖上，草繪粒子 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的位移 — 時間關係線圖。</p><p>(c) 求波長 λ。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/724253b8846940972a4f28af.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:343.9px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a)</p><p>(b)</p><p>(c) λ = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>v</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>T</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = 0.5 × 0.2 = 0.1 m</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/f97854f40b23694f70f9eb66.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:410.9px\"/></p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/5caf2b87d238c862c6ca9f64.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:410.6px\"/></p>","tips":"<p>技巧</p><p>繪圖</p><p>繪畫 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>s</mtext></mrow></mrow></math>–<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>t</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> 圖：先找出以下各項：</p><p>1 振幅</p><p>2 振動周期</p><p>3 粒子在某一時刻的移動方向</p><p>提示</p><p>A = 0.3 m, T = 0.2 s</p><p>在 t = 0 時，s = 0</p><p>波向左傳播</p><p>⇒ M 向下移動</p><p>⇒ s 變為負值</p><p>提示</p><p>P 與 M 同相</p><p>⇒ s–t 圖相同</p><p>O 與 M 反相</p><p>⇒ 在 t = 0 時向上移動</p>","think":"<p>N 的 s–t 圖是否取決於波的傳播方向？</p>","thinkAnswer":"<p>對圖示波形而言，不取決於傳播方向。在 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>t</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> 時，N 位於波谷，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>s</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>−</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow></mrow></math>，並瞬間靜止。無論波向哪個方向傳播，N 隨後都會向上移動。振幅及周期相同時，兩種情況下的位移均為 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>s</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>N</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>−</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>cos</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>(</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>π</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>t</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>)</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow></mrow></math>。</p>","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3B04_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"719143bc1d93724a7ffd6a651bc27c06d5bdf7dfaf3d342d53b6078897c1cbb9","segments":[{"page":25,"kind":"question","box":[185.4491,52.65489511718749,562.4491,346.91546630859375],"text":"例 題 8 繪畫不同粒子的位移—時間關係線圖\r\n橫波向左傳播，速率為 0.5 m s–1，週期為 0.2 s。下圖顯示波在時間\r\nt = 0 的波形。M、N、O 和 P 是波上的粒子。\r\nM O\r\nP\r\nN\r\n0.3 m\r\n傳播方向\r\n取向上為正。\r\n(a) 草繪粒子 M 從 t = 0 至 t = 0.4 s 的位移—時間關係線圖。\r\n(b) 在 (a) 的線圖上，草繪粒子 O 和 P 的位移—時間關係線圖。\r\n(c) 求波長 λ。\r\n"},{"page":25,"kind":"answer","box":[185.4491,346.91546630859375,562.4491,685.2548951171875],"text":"題解\r\n(a) \r\n– 0.3\r\n0\r\n0.3\r\n0.2 0.4\r\ns / m\r\nt / s\r\n(b) \r\n– 0.3\r\n0\r\n0.3\r\n0.2 0.4\r\nM 和 P\r\ns / m\r\nO\r\nt / s\r\n(c) λ = vT = 0.5 × 0.2 = 0.1 m\r\n"},{"page":25,"kind":"tips","box":[40,48.65489511718749,181.4491,685.2548951171875],"text":"提提你\r\nA = 0.3 m，T = 0.2 s\r\n在 t = 0，s = 0\r\n波向左傳播\r\n⇒ M 正向下移動\r\n⇒ s 變成負值\r\n提提你\r\nP 和 M 以同相振動\r\n⇒ 圖線相同\r\nO 和 M 以反相振動\r\n⇒ 在 t = 0，O 正向上移動\r\n繪畫位移—時間關\r\n係線圖\r\n找出以下資料：\r\n1 振幅\r\n2 振動週期\r\n3 粒子在某一刻的移動\r\n方向\r\n繪畫線圖\r\n技巧分析\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":"Complete Chinese translation of the English supplementary answer","sharedMathematicalAnswer":true,"englishAlignedFields":["tips","think","thinkAnswer"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-3B04-9":{"id":"ex-3B04-9","chapter":"3B04","number":9,"title":"波動的不同線圖","question":"<p>長繩子的一端連接到振動器，振動器啟動後，在繩上產生一列波長為0.6 m 的橫向行波。粒子 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> 與振動器相距 0.9 m。下圖顯示粒子 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的位移 — 時間關係線圖。</p><p>(a) 求波的振幅。</p><p>(b) 草繪在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0.8 s，從振動器至 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> 之間那一段波的位移 — 距離關係線圖。</p><p>(c) 草繪由 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0 至 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 1.6 s，<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的動能怎樣改變。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/dff2ddca27a233b8961f51be.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:392.1px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 0.2 m</p><p>(b)</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/a9b3424ef375dae1b0f16c95.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:380.6px\"></p><p>(c)</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/5b6de8c96aeedb32add7c285.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:262.1px\"></p><p>練習 4.4 第 5 題（第 29 頁）</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>A = 0.2 m, λ = 0.6 m</p><p>考慮 P（d = 0.9 m）。</p><p>在 t = 0.8 s 時，</p><p>s = 0 且正在減少</p><p>⇒ 波谷正在接近</p><p>提示</p><p>s = 0（在 t = 0、0.8 s、1.6 s 時）</p><p>⇒ 速率最高</p><p>⇒ 動能最大</p><p>s = 0.2 m（在 t = 0.4 s、1.2 s 時）</p><p>⇒ 瞬間靜止</p><p>⇒ KE = 0</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3B04_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"719143bc1d93724a7ffd6a651bc27c06d5bdf7dfaf3d342d53b6078897c1cbb9","segments":[{"page":27,"kind":"question","box":[185.4491,53.49989511718741,562.4491,383.5959777832031],"text":"例 題 9 波動的不同線圖\r\n長繩子的一端連接到振動器，振動器啟動後，在繩上產生一列波長為\r\n0.6 m 的橫向行波。粒子 P 與振動器相距 0.9 m。下圖顯示粒子 P 的\r\n位移—時間關係線圖。\r\n1.6 2.4 0 0.8\r\n–0.2\r\n0.2\r\n位移 / m\r\n時間 / s\r\n(a) 求波的振幅。\r\n(b) 草繪在 t = 0.8 s，從振動器至 P 之間那一段波的位移—距離關係\r\n線圖。\r\n(c) 草繪由 t = 0 至 t = 1.6 s，P 的動能怎樣改變。\r\n"},{"page":27,"kind":"answer","box":[185.4491,383.5959777832031,562.4491,747.6658951171875],"text":"題解\r\n(a) 0.2 m\r\n(b)\r\n0 0.3 0.6 0.9\r\n–0.2\r\n0.2\r\n位移 / m\r\n距離 / m\r\n(c)\r\n單元練習4.4 Q5 (p.29)\r\n0 0.8 1.6\r\n動能\r\n時間 / s\r\n"},{"page":27,"kind":"tips","box":[40,49.49989511718741,181.4491,747.6658951171875],"text":"提提你\r\nA = 0.2 m，λ = 0.6 m\r\n考慮 P (d = 0.9 m)。\r\n在 t = 0.8 s，\r\ns = 0而且正在減少\r\n⇒ 波谷正移向 P\r\n提提你\r\ns = 0（ 在 t = 0、0.8 s、\r\n1.6 s）\r\n⇒ 速率最高\r\n⇒ 動能最大\r\ns = 0.2 m（在 t = 0.4 s、\r\n1.2 s）\r\n⇒ 瞬時靜止\r\n⇒ 動能 = 0\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips","answer"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"}}